  "description": "Profile-driven Modbus RTU/TCP device reader for industrial test automation. Describe a device's register map (load cells, torque sensors, temperature/pressure transmitters) in a JSON profile and read all values as named, scaled, tared engineering values - with block-read optimisation, byte-order handling, Polly-based retries and async APIs. Built on NModbus.",
  "id": "ModbusDeviceKit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
