  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Partial reads (a failed request no longer fails the whole reading), automatic splitting of blocks the device rejects, WriteAsync for writable registers, ProbeAsync and ModbusBusScanner for commissioning.\n1.0.1: English README (Turkish version: README.tr.md on GitHub). No code changes.\n1.0.0: Initial release - JSON device profiles, Modbus RTU / TCP / RTU-over-TCP transports, block reads, byte-order support, tare/calibration, Polly retries.",
